WEBVTT

00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:26.580
It seems you have finished
your trial for the Land of Guidance.

00:00:27.670 --> 00:00:30.120
I will now head to El Dorado.

00:00:30.960 --> 00:00:35.300
Before that, there is
a place I wish you to visit.

00:00:35.590 --> 00:00:39.810
It is a land where a Horror
was sealed away long ago.

00:00:40.470 --> 00:00:42.330
Sealed, you say?

00:00:42.890 --> 00:00:47.190
The power of the seal has
weakened and will soon break.

00:00:48.190 --> 00:00:50.160
But, I have my role.

00:00:50.940 --> 00:00:55.460
True, it may be a detour to El Dorado.

00:00:56.160 --> 00:00:57.450
However...

00:00:57.450 --> 00:01:01.490
It may be a shortcut for you personally.

00:03:31.140 --> 00:03:33.660
D-Do you have some business with me?

00:03:34.440 --> 00:03:36.270
I saw the pattern on this door.

00:03:37.230 --> 00:03:37.860
You came!

00:03:38.140 --> 00:03:39.190
Came?

00:03:39.190 --> 00:03:41.390
You know what this mark is, don't you?!

00:03:41.950 --> 00:03:45.450
It's quite old, but it is something
made by a Makai Alchemist.

00:03:45.450 --> 00:03:48.510
A-A-A-Anyways! Please come in!

00:03:52.250 --> 00:03:53.530
Who is it?

00:04:01.510 --> 00:04:04.220
You bastard! What did
you do to my granddaughter?!

00:04:04.340 --> 00:04:06.010
That's not it, Grandpa.

00:04:06.010 --> 00:04:07.690
He's a customer.

00:04:08.430 --> 00:04:09.470
Huh?

00:04:09.470 --> 00:04:13.390
A-Aah. You should have 
said so from the start!

00:04:13.390 --> 00:04:16.190
I was about to beat him half to death!

00:04:16.520 --> 00:04:18.620
The Land of Guidance has brought me here.

00:04:18.900 --> 00:04:20.950
P-Please come inside!

00:04:32.910 --> 00:04:35.870
Um, may I ask you for your name?

00:04:36.540 --> 00:04:37.500
Luke.

00:04:37.500 --> 00:04:41.670
Mr. Luke. To put it plainly,
you are a Demon Sealer!

00:04:41.670 --> 00:04:42.720
Demon Sealer?

00:04:42.720 --> 00:04:45.050
The one from legend,
who will come to save this land.

00:04:45.050 --> 00:04:46.510
No, you're wrong.

00:04:46.510 --> 00:04:49.140
I-I-I-I'm wrong?!

00:04:49.140 --> 00:04:49.810
You're wrong.

00:04:49.810 --> 00:04:53.230
But you recognized the mark outside!

00:04:53.230 --> 00:04:57.520
That's true, but I've never
heard of the term Demon Sealer.

00:04:57.860 --> 00:04:59.570
No way.

00:04:59.570 --> 00:05:02.760
So you two aren't from our side?

00:05:03.110 --> 00:05:05.950
What side is your side?

00:05:07.030 --> 00:05:07.950
Excuse me.

00:05:07.950 --> 00:05:10.280
P-P-P-Please wait!

00:05:14.040 --> 00:05:18.750
This book was something
my grandpa's grandpa left behind.

00:05:22.920 --> 00:05:24.130
Makai Knight...

00:05:24.420 --> 00:05:27.510
Makai Knight? You know something, don't you?!

00:05:27.760 --> 00:05:31.190
Is this the Demon Sealer
you were talking about?

00:05:31.890 --> 00:05:34.140
"Demons lie in the darkness of this world,

00:05:34.140 --> 00:05:37.480
but there are ones who seal them."

00:05:37.480 --> 00:05:41.270
In the book, it says that
a demon was sealed here long ago.

00:05:41.770 --> 00:05:46.320
It is a land where a
Horror was sealed away long ago.

00:05:46.860 --> 00:05:50.220
"When the demon awakens,
a Demon Sealer shall appear."

00:05:50.950 --> 00:05:56.330
According to the book, the demon
will awaken on the next full moon.

00:05:56.960 --> 00:05:58.210
That's tomorrow.

00:05:59.330 --> 00:06:04.190
The power of the seal has
weakened and will soon break.

00:06:04.710 --> 00:06:09.930
So we've been waiting for
the Demon Sealer to appear here.

00:06:09.930 --> 00:06:13.520
Where is this so-called demon sealed?

00:06:13.930 --> 00:06:15.600
We don't know.

00:06:15.600 --> 00:06:19.340
We've searched the entire settlement, but...

00:06:19.850 --> 00:06:23.270
And the design on this
armor has been bothering me.

00:06:24.270 --> 00:06:27.820
Half of his armor painted 
black, are Demon S--

00:06:27.820 --> 00:06:31.740
Are the Makai Knights
you speak of like this, Mr. Luke?

00:06:32.160 --> 00:06:35.720
The only thing we know 
is that this is a drawing

00:06:35.720 --> 00:06:38.830
of a statue that used to be
on the outskirts of the settlement.

00:06:38.830 --> 00:06:39.750
Statue?

00:06:39.750 --> 00:06:44.630
It was destroyed by an earthquake.
Only the base is left.

00:06:44.630 --> 00:06:48.510
Grandpa has seen the original statue before.

00:06:48.510 --> 00:06:51.640
It was when I was still a toddler.

00:06:51.640 --> 00:06:54.050
Can you take me there?

00:06:55.470 --> 00:06:58.060
Y-Yes! Grandpa, let's go!

00:06:58.060 --> 00:06:59.230
Get in the wheelchair!

00:06:59.230 --> 00:07:00.270
Now, hurry!

00:07:00.270 --> 00:07:01.020
Grandpa!

00:07:01.020 --> 00:07:02.830
--Go!
--I got it! I got it!

00:07:03.400 --> 00:07:07.150
You treat Grandpa so roughly!

00:07:13.910 --> 00:07:15.870
Mr. Luke, I have a question!

00:07:15.870 --> 00:07:19.540
What is the Land of Guidance
you were talking about?

00:07:19.540 --> 00:07:20.960
I cannot answer.

00:07:20.960 --> 00:07:25.090
Is it a town? Ruins? Or maybe a cave?

00:07:25.250 --> 00:07:27.640
Could it be in space?!

00:07:28.460 --> 00:07:30.050
Stella!

00:07:30.050 --> 00:07:33.140
You've pulled in a random traveler again!

00:07:33.140 --> 00:07:35.050
I-I didn't pull him in!

00:07:35.050 --> 00:07:36.060
This person...

00:07:36.180 --> 00:07:39.350
I told you that you shouldn't
cause trouble to others!

00:07:39.350 --> 00:07:44.900
And, you know, you might end up
getting caught by some bad man!

00:07:44.900 --> 00:07:46.940
Huh? A bad man?

00:07:46.940 --> 00:07:51.030
You shouldn't trust men
with handsome faces easily!

00:07:51.030 --> 00:07:54.320
I'm sure he's made many women cry!

00:07:54.910 --> 00:07:56.160
Mr. Luke?

00:07:56.160 --> 00:07:58.290
A wild accusation.

00:07:58.290 --> 00:08:00.160
He says you're wrong!

00:08:00.160 --> 00:08:03.670
Don't worry! I'll make 
sure to protect you all!

00:08:03.670 --> 00:08:07.670
Saying such things again.
What will we do with you?

00:08:07.670 --> 00:08:12.050
Mr. Luke is the real deal! Right, Gra...

00:08:12.050 --> 00:08:12.630
Huh?

00:08:14.340 --> 00:08:17.010
Grandpa!

00:08:20.390 --> 00:08:20.810
Ouch!

00:08:39.950 --> 00:08:42.100
This is where the statue was.

00:08:43.000 --> 00:08:44.960
Just like in the book?

00:08:44.960 --> 00:08:47.410
Yeah, it was definitely here.

00:08:48.170 --> 00:08:50.920
But something seems off.

00:08:51.630 --> 00:08:53.300
What do you mean?

00:08:53.300 --> 00:08:57.470
He said that last time and
I tried standing on the base.

00:08:57.470 --> 00:08:59.600
In the end, we couldn't figure it out.

00:08:59.600 --> 00:09:03.020
Will you stand on the base for me?

00:09:03.600 --> 00:09:06.190
Maybe I'll remember something.

00:09:06.190 --> 00:09:07.020
Really?!

00:09:07.020 --> 00:09:09.650
No, you already said you tried that.

00:09:09.650 --> 00:09:11.940
P-Please! Mr. Luke!

00:09:11.940 --> 00:09:12.930
I refuse.

00:09:20.910 --> 00:09:24.580
Oh! You definitely
look better on it than Stella.

00:09:24.580 --> 00:09:26.080
Please hurry.

00:09:26.080 --> 00:09:29.970
He stood like that with his sword raised up.

00:09:30.590 --> 00:09:33.420
Hey. Hey. Stella's up to something again.

00:09:34.210 --> 00:09:35.670
Who's the guy on top?

00:09:35.670 --> 00:09:37.630
His face looks totally into it!

00:09:37.630 --> 00:09:39.760
So scary! He seems so scary!

00:09:40.010 --> 00:09:43.530
It's okay, Mr. Luke! You look cool!

00:09:44.220 --> 00:09:45.890
Well, Grandpa?

00:09:45.890 --> 00:09:48.830
Hmm. There's still something off...

00:10:02.580 --> 00:10:03.740
Isn't that enough?

00:10:03.740 --> 00:10:05.200
P-Please wait!

00:10:06.660 --> 00:10:07.710
Shadows...

00:10:07.710 --> 00:10:10.040
This isn't a design, but shadows!

00:10:10.380 --> 00:10:11.380
Shadows?

00:10:11.380 --> 00:10:16.130
Grandpa, you said there used
to be a praying tradition, right?

00:10:16.130 --> 00:10:18.240
Right at high noon.

00:10:19.130 --> 00:10:24.600
Like right now! The ways the
shadows should fall at this time of day...

00:10:24.600 --> 00:10:27.380
Mr. Luke, please face that way!

00:10:36.490 --> 00:10:38.530
Oh, I see! I see!

00:10:38.820 --> 00:10:40.780
Now I understand!

00:10:40.780 --> 00:10:43.780
The view behind the statue was different!

00:10:46.660 --> 00:10:48.210
Mr. Luke?

00:11:07.140 --> 00:11:09.060
In a place like this?

00:11:13.400 --> 00:11:14.510
The seal...

00:11:22.870 --> 00:11:24.270
Amazing...

00:11:54.060 --> 00:11:55.330
Mr. Luke.

00:11:56.190 --> 00:11:59.140
This is the place of sealing.

00:12:48.740 --> 00:12:50.860
M-Mr. Luke?

00:12:53.540 --> 00:12:57.250
S-So the demon's true form
is this thing called a Horror?

00:12:57.250 --> 00:12:58.040
Yes.

00:12:58.040 --> 00:13:00.750
It takes advantage of the greed
within people, possesses them,

00:13:00.750 --> 00:13:05.050
and then begins to eat others.
The ones who protect the people are--

00:13:05.050 --> 00:13:07.090
Makai Knights!

00:13:07.090 --> 00:13:12.680
But the one sealed there is
a Knight that became a Horror.

00:13:12.680 --> 00:13:13.560
Huh?!

00:13:13.560 --> 00:13:18.560
Our duty is to constantly face
the darkness of Horrors.

00:13:18.730 --> 00:13:23.740
If our hearts sway as
we stay within that darkness,

00:13:23.740 --> 00:13:27.160
it will consume us in an instant.

00:13:38.460 --> 00:13:39.040
It's good.

00:13:39.040 --> 00:13:41.840
Really?! You're not just being nice?!

00:13:41.840 --> 00:13:42.920
I'm not.

00:13:43.130 --> 00:13:46.930
Only in cooking,
am I a little bit above average!

00:13:47.130 --> 00:13:51.780
I wish she showed
more interest in things like this.

00:13:52.560 --> 00:13:56.980
Oh, come to think of it,
where is your sword and armor, Mr. Luke?

00:13:57.350 --> 00:13:58.650
I have neither.

00:13:58.850 --> 00:14:00.190
Huh?! Why?!

00:14:00.480 --> 00:14:02.110
I am not a Knight.

00:14:02.940 --> 00:14:06.070
B-But you can still defeat it, right?

00:14:06.780 --> 00:14:10.790
I'll have to. I'm the only one here.

00:14:11.200 --> 00:14:13.160
I-I-It'll be all right!

00:14:13.160 --> 00:14:15.660
I'll help you as much as I can!

00:14:16.290 --> 00:14:17.460
There's no need for that.

00:14:17.460 --> 00:14:21.000
Oh! I'll need to prepare
a lot of demon warding goods!

00:14:33.310 --> 00:14:34.520
Am I bothering you?

00:14:35.390 --> 00:14:36.350
No.

00:14:38.100 --> 00:14:40.910
She's a good girl, that Stella.

00:14:41.520 --> 00:14:45.900
She's always been a kind girl
that always thinks of others.

00:14:47.320 --> 00:14:50.030
Her parents are always traveling for work,

00:14:50.240 --> 00:14:52.850
and they aren't home for most of the year.

00:14:53.700 --> 00:14:56.620
She never complained
about having to play alone,

00:14:56.620 --> 00:15:02.040
and I told her about the legend
in hopes of entertaining her.

00:15:02.330 --> 00:15:08.840
After that, regional legends,
urban legends, UFO, UMA...

00:15:08.840 --> 00:15:11.760
In other words,
she fell in love with the occult.

00:15:14.010 --> 00:15:17.200
Even at her age, she doesn't care
about things like dressing up.

00:15:18.140 --> 00:15:24.610
About half a year ago,
she pulled out that book from storage.

00:15:24.610 --> 00:15:29.400
She said that everyone was
in danger and asked every traveler

00:15:29.400 --> 00:15:32.840
if they were the Demon 
Sealer from the legend.

00:15:34.530 --> 00:15:37.840
I thought I'd let her do things
until she was satisfied, but...

00:15:38.580 --> 00:15:41.710
...I never expected the legend to be true.

00:15:42.170 --> 00:15:44.250
So you didn't believe in it?

00:15:44.750 --> 00:15:50.510
Yes. I wonder if I have
done something terrible.

00:15:51.720 --> 00:15:53.260
There's nothing to worry about.

00:15:53.840 --> 00:15:55.980
I will not get her involved.

00:15:56.600 --> 00:15:59.370
I see. That puts me at ease.

00:16:02.230 --> 00:16:04.440
Why didn't you wake me up?!

00:16:04.440 --> 00:16:06.860
He told me to thank you.

00:16:07.480 --> 00:16:08.400
I'm going!

00:16:08.400 --> 00:16:11.530
Don't! You won't be able
to do anything even if you go!

00:16:12.490 --> 00:16:14.990
He left you behind
because you will get in the way!

00:16:14.990 --> 00:16:17.080
But, Mr. Luke doesn't have a sword or armor!

00:16:17.080 --> 00:16:21.210
Even so, that man had a reason he had to go!

00:16:21.210 --> 00:16:22.330
You don't!

00:16:22.330 --> 00:16:24.120
Don't you care what
will happen here, Grandpa?!

00:16:24.120 --> 00:16:24.990
I don't!

00:16:25.630 --> 00:16:28.500
As long as you are alive.

00:16:29.630 --> 00:16:30.700
Grandpa...

00:16:31.840 --> 00:16:35.410
Stella, let's leave things to that man.

00:17:25.270 --> 00:17:27.660
I probably only have one chance.

00:18:15.360 --> 00:18:16.700
He's strong!

00:18:24.750 --> 00:18:26.580
I-I-I-I'm sorry!

00:18:26.580 --> 00:18:29.880
I was only planning on watching,
but it looked like you were in trouble!

00:18:45.640 --> 00:18:46.670
Get back!

00:18:57.320 --> 00:18:59.570
I will definitely protect you.

00:19:10.120 --> 00:19:13.130
You were once a great Knight.

00:19:14.090 --> 00:19:17.260
Did the weight of your duty
cause you to step off the path?

00:19:21.590 --> 00:19:26.890
No. You were consumed
in your moment of weakness

00:19:26.890 --> 00:19:28.980
and lost sight of the people
you were meant to protect!

00:19:32.480 --> 00:19:36.400
You forgot the strength of a loving heart!

00:19:42.200 --> 00:19:49.660
Even if someone falls, their hope
is passed on and grows in strength.

00:19:52.040 --> 00:19:56.250
Now, I am sure of it!

00:20:01.130 --> 00:20:05.550
Unnamed warriors, I have inherited your will!

00:20:51.020 --> 00:20:52.640
Thank you for taking care of me.

00:20:52.640 --> 00:20:53.890
Be careful.

00:20:53.890 --> 00:20:56.940
I'll never forget you, Mr. Luke!

00:20:56.940 --> 00:21:00.780
Hey, now. It'll be hard
for him to leave if you cry.

00:21:00.780 --> 00:21:04.240
I'll pass down your story forever, Mr. Luke!

00:21:04.240 --> 00:21:06.450
No, that isn't necessary.

00:21:06.700 --> 00:21:07.530
Huh?

00:21:08.740 --> 00:21:10.200
Wh-What is it?

00:21:10.830 --> 00:21:13.620
You shouldn't come to our side.

00:21:13.620 --> 00:21:14.960
Mr. Luke?

00:21:26.050 --> 00:21:26.980
Take care.

00:21:32.640 --> 00:21:33.830
I...

00:21:36.560 --> 00:21:37.980
What's this?

00:21:38.400 --> 00:21:40.970
Did I do something again?

00:21:41.900 --> 00:21:44.650
Huh?! The full moon has already passed?!

00:21:44.820 --> 00:21:49.240
I don't really remember, myself.
I wonder if I'm going senile?

00:21:49.240 --> 00:21:51.660
What about the seal?! The Demon Sealer?!

00:21:52.370 --> 00:21:54.620
Nothing happened.

00:21:57.120 --> 00:21:58.130
Stella...

00:22:00.040 --> 00:22:04.740
Thank goodness everyone is safe.
So it was just a superstition!
